      "message": "Even if it\u0027s being done in other middleware, this is effectively a shim for an incorrect configuration that should be a temporary solution at the very best. I don\u0027t want to include pieces like this in as a \"new\" piece of code, regardless of the shims left in older code. \n\nFunctionally, as long as the configuration is correct, this extra bit won\u0027t make any difference.",
